         *   utm_medium  = free_plugin | pro_plugin (acquisition vs cross-sell)
         *   utm_campaign= upgrade_pro (override for xsell_<target> / license_*)
         *   utm_content = the exact placement, e.g. feature_lock_advanced_inventory
